  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Order",
      "items": [
        "dispatch_commit when a plan applies, then dispatch_inputs, then claim_assign for an implementation lane, then the delegation",
        "A round is concurrent only if all its delegations are issued in the same response"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Identity",
      "items": [
        "The delegation name is the unit identity; the same name again retries it, new work gets a new name",
        "claim_assign without author_key never takes a path another root's claim holds: continue that work with its author_key, or release or discard it first",
        "With the author_key, claim_assign continues the existing staged work and may extend its exact scope"
      ]
    }
  ]
